T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qlak"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28b1c846-31da-4a8d-a3a0-63766c778515","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"理解しました。とはいえしかしStopServerだけじゃなくてRestartServerも欲しいと思いました","ts":"1632450470.123000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q0aF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8b55bcf-45cf-4561-9df4-b7ae93b107ff","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ、raaさんが正解でした\n別に保存とか要らなかったです","ts":"1632450365.122300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mAKw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca1817ea-f04f-4ed0-8e26-100694538dac","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ、今見たらたしかに保存せずに放置でも再起動しました :thinking-sun:\n…？ :thinking_ie:","ts":"1632450257.121900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hjss"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45004d27-3936-45cd-a883-d6f8e88b9298","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"エラーがある状態で、LspStopServer → 改行追加 →ちょっと待つとエラーが表示される","ts":"1632450256.121800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VJf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6d40c48-874f-4fac-b141-0ce8ab6159d9","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"バッファに変更があったら起動します","ts":"1632450211.120800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"STn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c28ce582-897c-4e76-9f07-23f1eab94eae","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あれ、本当ですか。\nいつも余計な改行追加→保存してフォーマットされて改行削除→フォーマットの実行とgopls再起動を確認\nっていう無駄な手間を踏んでました…","ts":"1632450210.120700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GUo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35a7840d-c940-479b-a76a-92c10219ba5a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Vim でだと、保存はしなくても、改行追加とかでいけますね","ts":"1632449989.119800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wgqaT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd8d0463-43ad-4393-ad3e-05576e71fe15","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ、そうだそれで何が問題かというと、vim-lspでは「再起動」がなくて「終了」しかないので、\n終了したあと何か保存とかのアクションをしないと再起動してくれない気がするんですよね\nこれ合ってますかね…？","ts":"1632449950.119300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rjs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2079526-1ebb-409c-9a27-a4acbe85d1c1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"私は再起動してますね","ts":"1632449715.118300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pm19m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ff3ef6c-7de7-46e8-985d-22f7971b3269","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u003c#CQ57P4XU4|tech-lsp\u003e 案件なんですけど、go mod tidyとかでimportまわりに変更があった場合、\ngoplsを再起動しないと状態が正しくならないという認識で合ってますよね？\nvscodeでも同じ挙動だった気がする","ts":"1632449511.117900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+QHBU"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01DE459A02","text":"\u003c@U01DE459A02\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1632445688.116900","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
